mpact-plan/media/command-control-operational-briefing/command-control-operational-briefing-480.webp",{"_216":307,"_199":221,"_201":291},{"_216":306,"_199":218,"_201":289},{"_216":305,"_199":250,"_201":287},{"_216":304,"_199":275,"_201":276},"/irg-donor-impact-plan/media/command-control-operational-briefing/command-control-operational-briefing-1280.avif","/irg-donor-impact-plan/media/command-control-operational-briefing/command-control-operational-briefing-1200.avif","/irg-donor-impact-plan/media/command-control-operational-briefing/command-control-operational-briefing-800.avif","/irg-donor-impact-plan/media/command-control-operational-briefing/command-control-operational-briefing-480.avif","whatWeDoHtml","<p>IRG&#39;s Command and Control Section is the operational backbone of every mission. This team maintains uninterrupted communication, mobile command infrastructure, and the real-time situational awareness that keeps every section aligned. In disaster zones, communications infrastructure is often the first casualty—Command and Control Section bridges the gap until restoration.</p>","howWeDoItHtml","<ul>\n<li>Satellite internet deployment (Starlink, etc.) at field command posts and staging areas.</li>\n<li>Digital App Chat for instant communications via text, voice, or video across multiple platforms.</li>\n<li>Radio network setup across multiple bands.</li>\n<li>Proprietary integrated digital command dashboard to provide a common operating picture across responding organizations.</li>\n<li>Cybersecurity and COMSEC protocols to protect sensitive operational data.</li>\n<li>Field computing: ruggedized laptops, tablets, encrypted drives, and mobile hotspots.</li>\n<li>Power systems: generators, solar charging kits, and battery banks for off-grid stability.</li>\n<li>Integration with ATAK, Maptician, and partner agency communication platforms.</li>\n</ul>","donationFundsHtml","<p>Your donation funds satellite systems, radios, power equipment, and field computing tools that enable rapid deployment of our team. Without this core infrastructure, there is no organized response.</p>",{"_57":323,"_318":324,"_320":309},{"_57":321,"_318":322,"_320":311},{"_57":317,"_318":319,"_320":313},"what-your-donation-funds","heading","What your donation funds","html","how-we-do-it","How we do it","what-we-do","What we do"]
